  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I'm imagining that this is a fcrepo organization repository with a docker file and a version controlled instance of the Fedora Dashboard.  Depending on whether or not Grafana can be configured programmatically we may need to manual create the container and then snap the image.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Use the following documentation for setting it up: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Metrics"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Metrics",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It would also be good if the sample docker-compose for bringing up fedora, prometheus, and grafana lives in this repo.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
