  "description": "<p>I'm imagining that this is a fcrepo organization repository with a docker file and a version controlled instance of the Fedora Dashboard.  Depending on whether or not Grafana can be configured programmatically we may need to manual create the container and then snap the image.</p>\n\n<p>Use the following documentation for setting it up: <br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Metrics\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Metrics</a></p>\n\n<p>It would also be good if the sample docker-compose for bringing up fedora, prometheus, and grafana lives in this repo.</p>",
